    "description": "<p>The leader moves and her soldiers move with her, as inevitably as the tail follows the serpent's head. When the Dragon-Blood performs any move action, she may reflexively activate this Charm to move her complementary unit along with her, provided it is within short range. The unit moves as one formation, tracking her new position. The movement counts as the unit's action for the tick on which it occurs. Furthermore, the unit does not suffer terrain penalties on this movement that are less than or equal to the Exalt's Athletics rating, as their leader's perfect footwork guides them through obstacles.</p>",
